Numbers of nuggets that boxes of 6, 9 and 20 cannot make, up to 100:
1 2 3 4 5 7 8 10 11 13 14 16 17 19 22 23 25 28 31 34 37 43
The largest non-McNuggets number: 43

Six in a row can be made, so every larger number can too (add boxes of 6):
44 = 6 x 4 + 9 x 0 + 20 x 1
45 = 6 x 6 + 9 x 1 + 20 x 0
46 = 6 x 1 + 9 x 0 + 20 x 2
47 = 6 x 3 + 9 x 1 + 20 x 1
48 = 6 x 8 + 9 x 0 + 20 x 0
49 = 6 x 0 + 9 x 1 + 20 x 2
